# Licence for the data in this repository

## What this covers

Everything in `data/`:

- `feature11.csv` — the layer-wise feature table for the 50 printed samples
- `condition_labels.csv` — the measured thickness, storage modulus and degree
  of conversion for the same 50 samples
- `waveforms_15L_I1.npz`, `waveforms_15L_I7.npz`, `waveforms_30L_I7.npz` —
  raw ultrasonic A-scans for three representative prints

